3.5 Proposed Novelty

The proposed novelty lies in the integration of AI-based crop disease
detection, smart agrochemical recommendation, and post-quantum secure
cloud communication into a unified smart agriculture framework.

The project does not claim to invent a new CNN or a new PQC
algorithm.

Primary Contribution

Integration + Implementation + Evaluation

