3.7 Final Research-Gap Statement for PPT

Existing studies effectively address crop disease detection,
agrochemical recommendation, and secure communication individually.
However, limited work integrates these components into a unified
agricultural framework. AgroPQ addresses this gap by combining
AI-based disease detection, disease-aware agrochemical recommendation,
and post-quantum secure cloud communication.

